    {
      "short": "Recap",
      "chapter": "recap",
      "title": "Recap",
      "body": [
        "<ul class=\"takeaways\">\n          <li>Store passwords as <b>slow, salted hashes</b> (argon2id, bcrypt).</li>\n          <li>Sessions in <b>HttpOnly, Secure</b> cookies, or short-lived tokens.</li>\n          <li>Stop stuffing with <b>rate limits</b>, breach checks and a <b>second factor</b>.</li>\n          <li>Make <b>password reset</b> as strong as login; <b>passkeys</b> defeat phishing.</li>\n          <li>Consider an <b>identity provider</b>; keep tokens <b>short-lived and revocable</b>.</li>\n        </ul>"
      ],
      "callout": {
        "kind": "next",
        "text": "Next up: <b>Authorization</b> — knowing who someone is doesn’t tell you what they may do."
